title: "adapt_decomp: adaptive EMG decomposition in dynamic conditions based on online learning metrics with tunable hyperparameters"
abstract: >-
  Python package to decompose high-density EMG into motor unit firings during dynamic
  contractions in real time: convolutive blind source separation calibration, online
  adaptation of the decomposition, and hyperparameter optimisation.
